        "description": "Bel'Veth dashes in a chosen direction and damages all enemies she passes through.",
        "tooltip": "Bel'Veth dashes, dealing <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(12/14/16/18/20 + (105% Attack Damage)) physical damage</span> to enemies she passes through.<br /><br />Each direction has an unique Cooldown of seconds that scales down based on her <span>Attack Speed</span>.<br /><br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Applies On-Hit Effects to the first target hit.<br />Each <span>1% Attack Speed</span> is equivalent to 0.2 Ability Haste for this Ability's per-direction Cooldown.<br />Bel'Veth does an additional <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">70 physical damage</span> to monsters.</span>",
