      {
        "id": "BelvethR",
        "name": "Endless Banquet",
        "description": "Bel'Veth consumes Void coral remnants, transforming into her true form and increasing her max health, attack range, and attack speed. Consuming the Void coral remnants of a Void epic monster will grant her the power to summon Void remora.",
        "tooltip": "<span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-500 italic\">Passive:</span> Attacks deal an additional <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-500 font-semibold\">(2/4/6 + (3% bonus Attack Damage)) true damage</span>, stacking infinitely. Takedowns against champions and epic monsters leave behind a piece of Void Coral.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-semibold\">Active:</span> Bel'Veth consumes a Void Coral, gaining <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">1 Lavender</span> stack and activating her true form. Void Coral from void epic monsters causes minions that die nearby to become Void Remora. While casting, Bel'Veth <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slows</span> nearby enemies before exploding, dealing <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-500 font-semibold\">(150/200/250 + (150% Ability Power)) + 20% missing-Health true damage</span>.<br /><br />In her true form, Bel'Veth gains <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">(100/250/400 + (150% bonus Attack Damage) + (150% Ability Power)) max Health</span>, 25/75/125 Attack range, <span>6/13/20% Total Attack Speed</span>, and <span>Void Surge</span> can pass through walls.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">True form lasts 45 seconds, increased to 90 seconds at <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">40 Lavender</span> stacks. At <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">80 Lavender</span> stacks, true form lasts until death.</span><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Void Remora count as lane minions with <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">20/45/70% Health</span> and <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">110% Attack Damage</span>.<br />The applied <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slow</span> ramps up to 99% while Bel'Veth consumes Void Coral. <br />The passive deals a maximum of <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-500 font-semibold\">(16/32/48 + (24% bonus Attack Damage)) true damage</span> to epic monsters.<br />While in true form, consuming Void Coral renews the form's duration and restores <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">100/250/400 Health</span>.</span><br />",
